      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.51 (up from ₹0.23 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹361.5m (down 1.1% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹3.97m (up 120% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.1% (up from 0.5% in FY 2025). The increase in margin was driven by lower expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 37% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 11% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
